window.products.push({"id":72086,"name":"Reusable Coffee Capsule Filter, Stainless Steel Coffee Pod Holder Set Compatible with Nespresso Vertuoline GCA1/Plus, Nespresso Vertuo Plus Series, De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61djzvx+nWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Reusable and Save Money】Use your favorite coffee that can be reused to protect the environment and save money. 240ml can brew about 8 ounces of coffee in a few minutes. 【Tough Stainless Steel】The capsule is made of high-quality stainless steel, which is corrosion-resistant, acid-resistant, easy to clean, and has a long service life. Note: If the coffee tastes too light or the capsule produces no water or less water. There are several reasons: 1. Too much powder; 2. The powder is pressed too tightly; 3. The coffee powder is too fine; 4. The water outlet or filter is blocked. Please get and adjust; 5. Not suitable for capsules. 【Easy to use】First heat the coffee filter with hot water, then add the coffee powder, then slowly pour in the hot water, let the coffee machine drip water from the fine pouring filter, and finally you need to take out the coffee when you are done Drip filter and ready to enjoy your drink. 【Compatible Machines and Suitable Beans】Stainless Steel Coffee Capsule Filter Compatible with Nespresso Vertuolline GCA1, Nespresso Vertuo Plus BNV450WHT1BUC1 and Delonghi ENV150. The recommended bean size is medium roast or dark roast. (Coffee edema is affected by the quality and freshness of the espresso powder you choose.) 【ECO-FRIENDLY】Non-toxic and eco-friendly: When you choose our reusable and refillable stainless steel Vertuo espresso capsules, you choose a greener life and help our planet move away from more plastic and aluminum. NOTE: If the machine shows a red light, do the injection first and check: A grind that is too fine can block the socket. Stop the machine from cooling, wait a minute, then turn it back on again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61djzvx+nWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECA","source_asin":"B09YXNXDGB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-72086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YXNXDGB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YXNXDGB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
