window.products.push({"id":72220,"name":"Modern By Design 100 Pack 4\" x 12\" Cold Brew Coffee Filter, Disposable Mesh Brewing Sock for Concentrate Coffee/Tea, Use with Flasks, Bottles, Mason J","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81odYQx2Y3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAVE MONEY AND TIME BY MAKING YOUR OWN COLD BREW COFFEE AT HOME!!! Use with any container you have at home. For extra large container use multiple brew bags. MODERN BY DESIGN 4\" x 12\" Cold Brew Coffee Filter Bags We at Modern By Design love coffee and have been making our own cold brew at home for years now. Cold brew coffee really brings out the flavor of the coffee beans without the bitterness and acidity that you would get from a hot cup of joe. Working with our manufacturer we wanted to have an affordable cold brew coffee filter bag that can be used at home (to make a week worth) and by a local retail coffee shop.  The filter bags are designed to filter out the impurities and oils to provide a clean and smooth mouth feel in your delicious cup of cold brew. Use any type of large container you have at home.  Whats Included: - 1x Large resealable bag to hold the filters  - 100x Large 4” wide by 12” tall strong brewing filter bag  How to Brew Cold Brew Concentrate: 1) Grind your coffee beans into a coarse grind 2) Insert filter into your brewing container 3) Add coarse coffee grinds to the filter (start with 1 ounce of coffee per cup of water and adjust accordingly on future brews to your own taste) 4) Slowly pour cold filtered water over the coffee beans and stir to incorporate 5) Tie bag and close the lid 6) Steep coffee overnight between 12 - 24 hours 7) Slowly remove the filter bag of coffee and let it strain 8) Your cold brew concentrate is now ready! Note: Coffee NOT included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81odYQx2Y3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modern By Design","source_asin":"B08BYJRCKF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-72220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BYJRCKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BYJRCKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
