window.products.push({"id":72296,"name":"Mini Fridge Stand Mobile Base With 4 Locking Refrigerator Wheels And 8 Strong Feet For Washer Dryer Washing Machine Stand Pedestal, Refrigerator Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eJrah4GlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ADJUSTABLE SIZE】This mobile base can be adjusted from 18 inches to 28 inches. Measure your appliance before purchase. There are 8 height adjustable feet with suction cup, they will hold your appliance firmly. Maximum weight it can handle is 500 lbs. If you have a washer weight 500 lbs itself, you CAN'T use this leg support. Because once you add water and clothes into it, total weight will be over 500 lbs. If you have an appliance longer OR wider than 28 inches, you CAN'T use this leg support. 【UNIVERSAL】The moving roller is applied at the bottom of appliances (portable washing machines, washer and dryer, refrigerator or mini fridge). It lifts the appliance up to 5.2\" higher from the floor. Less humidity will extend the life cycle of the washing machine and dryer. 2nd image show all the dimension of this leg support including wheels, feet, etc. Please READ them CAREFULLY and measure your appliance BEFORE purchase. If you have any question before purchase, please contact us. 【MULTI-USE】The appliance rollers also move furniture or appliance easily like rolling dollies. 4 DOUBLE swivel casters come with lock. Lock your washer dolly once it is in the right position. Lock on the wheel need to be COMPLETELY lifted if you want to move the unit. Lock the frame COMPLETELY after installation. Otherwise the pole will move and leg support will shake. 【DURABLE CONSTRUCTION】Our washer stand washing machine pedestal comes with bigger 8\" platform. It will hold weight up to 500 lbs. Upgraded version takes 1 minutes to install. All feet and wheels were installed. You just need to install the frame and lock in the right position. 【Noise reduction and Anti-Vibration】This roller base is equipped with black anti-vibration rubber pads, which can reduce slipping movement, stabilize the washer, reduce the noise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eJrah4GlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMERICAN HAWKS","source_asin":"B08JYLSD57","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-72296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JYLSD57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JYLSD57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
