window.products.push({"id":72300,"name":"Awoco Split Super Quiet Range Hood Inline Blower Unit And Control, 4 Speeds 800CFM 6\" Round Vent (6\" Blower + Control)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Lq1dAMTLL._SL1280_.jpg","description":"Why It Is Super Quiet? Mostly the range hood noise is the sound of air whooshing the steam away. The blower exhausts the air out, sucking the nearby air to one direction. For example, the house fan has bigger noise at higher speed, the sound is from the air collision, not the motor. High speed air collision is the cause of the powerful range hood. What if we move the air collision from the kitchen area to above the ceiling? The restaurant exhaust fans are on the roof; therefore, moving the blower to the attic is the solution for residential to eliminate the range hood noise. Same as the industrial inline blower, this Blower unit is in between the house exhaust vent and the range hood unit. Super Quiet, Still Using Your Own Hood Keep your own hood unit but improve the exhausting performance and quiet operation. Mount the Blower unit in the attic, and keep the kitchen quiet. 4-speed blue-lighted soft touch electronic buttons control panel. Very nice looking stainless steel control panel with 2 holes for easy mounting. This is much better than the noisy mechanical push buttons. Also no annoying “beep” sound while pressing on the buttons. Other Features & Specifications: Venting Type: 6” round ducts (not included) for Blower air inlet and outlet. (Hardware stores have various adaptors.) Venting Type: 6” round ducts (not included) for Blower air inlet and outlet. (Hardware stores have various adaptors.) 1 Motor and one 7\" wide Centrifugal Squirrel Cage Fan Wheel 1 Motor and one 7\" wide Centrifugal Squirrel Cage Fan Wheel Optional removable 2 of 1.5W energy efficient cold bright LED Lights Optional removable 2 of 1.5W energy efficient cold bright LED Lights Power rating: 120V/60Hz, 110W Min /150W Max Power rating: 120V/60Hz, 110W Min /150W Max Noise levels: 40dB / 50dB / 56dB / 60dB Noise levels: 40dB / 50dB / 56dB / 60dB Package includes: Blower unit with air damper on top air outlet Blower unit with air damper on top air outlet Stainless steel control panel Stainless steel control panel Circuit box with power cord Circuit box with power cord 2 Removable LED Lights 2 Removable LED Lights 2 Mounting brackets, screws & electric nuts 2 Mounting brackets, screws & electric nuts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Lq1dAMTLL._SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Awoco","source_asin":"B086WN2X6K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-72300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086WN2X6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B086WN2X6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
