window.products.push({"id":72367,"name":"Refrigerator Compressor Relay and Overload Kit JJHXSM Refrigerator Starters QP2-4R7 4.7 Ohm 1 Pin Refrigerator PTC Starter Relays and 6750C-0005P Refr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cDK0g7pWL._AC_SL1354_.jpg","description":"The QP2-4.7 is a very versatile starter relay used in various brands of mini fridges, beer kegs, wine centres and beverage coolers. Buying two spares is your best option. Fix the following symptoms:  The compressor does not start; burning; It \"clicks\" approximately every 3-5 minutes when turned on.  Replace the following part numbers: QP2-4R7 / QP2-4.7 / QP2-4.7G12 / WS-EP14F / 3990100070 / 6R8MD3 / AP4565041 / 1206682.  Compatible brands and models include, but are not limited to: EdgeStar, Danby, Summit, Whirlpool, Frgidaire, Kenmore, Haier, Igloo, Magic Chef, Vissani, Summit and more EdgeStar VBR240 VBR440 VBR640.  Working principle: When the motor starts, it must overcome its inertia and the reaction force of the load. Therefore, a large current and torque are required when the motor is started. When turning normal, in order to save energy and large torque, it is necessary to reduce the voltage, and add a set of auxiliary to the motor coil. It only works when it is turned on, and it is normal after disconnection. When starting, the PTC thermistor is connected in series with the auxiliary coil, and the PTC thermistor enters high The effect can be achieved by cutting off the secondary coil in the resistance state.  Specification: Type: Refrigerator PTC Start Relay Model: QP2-4.7 Pins: 3 pins Resistance: 4.7 ohms Material: Metal and Plastic Colour: Black Overall Dimensions: 1.3 x 0.8 x 1.1inch (LxWxH)  Kind tips: This is not an original product and any related model names mentioned above are only to demonstrate compatibility.  The package includes:  1PC 4.7 Ohm 1 Pin PTC Start Relay  1PC 1/2HP Refrigerator Overload Protector","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cDK0g7pWL._AC_SL1354_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JJHXSM","source_asin":"B0B4RDTGRL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-72367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4RDTGRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4RDTGRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
