window.products.push({"id":72589,"name":"Portable Washing Machine, Mini Washing Machine Ultrasonic Turbine Wash, Mini Portable Washer for Underwear, Sock, Baby Clothes, Travel, Camping, Dorm,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lSezAaEML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tiptop Home portable mini automatic washing machine is the best assistant for your life. Thanks to the foldable and wall-mounted design, our ultrasonic turbine washer machine is perfect for home, travel, camping, RV, dorm, and apartment. 💯Main Feature: ✔ Turbine forward and reverse cleaning to reach a better clean effect. ✔ Powerful ultrasonic high-frequency vibration to get refreshing bubbles, remove dirt without residue and irritants. ✔ 30 mins auto stop washing to ensure safe. ✔ Low noise does not disturb your work or sleep. 💯How to Assemble: 1. Stick the sucker tightly on the smooth side of the turbine. 2. Fix the turbine at the bottom of the collapsible bucket. 3. Hold up the collapsible bucket. 4. Fill with a suitable volume of water. 5. Connect power with the USB cable. 💯Warm Tips:1. Keep away from the children, it's not a toy.2. Do not touch the fan blades of the turbine when the washing machine is rotating to avoid accidents.3. Do not dip the USB power plug into water or other liquids to avoid short circuits and burning components.4. Unplug the power after washing.5. Use an adapter with 5V/5A output power for optimal performance.6. Only for small items, cleaning large products may damage the machine.7. Each washer is functionally tested before leaving the factory, Please forgive for a small amount of water or water marks inside the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lSezAaEML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiptop Home","source_asin":"B0BWJ99XTG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-72589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWJ99XTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWJ99XTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
