window.products.push({"id":72630,"name":"2 Burner Electric Cooktop, NOXTON 12 inch Built-in Electric Stove Top, 3000W 220-240v Ceramic Cooktop with Knob Control 9 Heating Level, Hot Warning, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LcS84vW+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️【Knob Controlled Electric Stove】Compared with other multi-functional sensor touch controlled electric stoves, this knob controlled electric cooktop hasn't complicated buttons or functions. Each knob controls only one burner, so even for the elderly, this electric radiant cooktop is very useful and simple. Most of the elderly have poor eyesight, so electric cooktop with knob is a better choice for them. ✔️ 【220-240V Drop-in Electric Stove 3000W 】 Generally speaking, low-power electric ceramic stove heat slowly. To solve this problem, our electric ceramic cooktop will provide a high power of up to 3000W. In order to achieve such high power, the 12 \"electric stove top needs to be connected to 220-240V. It has no plug. If you don't know how to install it, you need to find an electrician. High power burner, faster heating. ✔️【3000W High Power Ceramic & 9 Power Level】Noxton 12'' electric cootkop 2 burners is 1200 and 1800watts ,the total power is up to 3000W. High power electric stovetop heats faster than others. The 12'' electric stove top has 9 power levels, which can meet the needs of various foods for different temperatures, perfect for heating, steam, frying, deep-frying, hot pot, grilling, boiling,roasting. This electric stove two burners can work at the same time, saving you half the time. ✔️【Multiple Protection Ceramic Cooktop】This electric stove has no redundant buttons or complicated functions. But it is very safe. It has a residual heat indicator, overheating protection and automatic shutdown. When the electric hob detects that the internal temperature is abnormal, it will automatically shut down, giving you the greatest protection. The ceramic cooktop works by far infrared heating and has no electromagnetic radiation,can also be used by pregnant women. ✔️【Convenient Electric Hot Plate】The double burners cooktop is very convenient because electric ceramic cooktop it's compatible with any Flat-bottomed kitchenware. With a black glass, the drop-in design electric cooktop looks very modern and fashionable. High quality black glass is easy to clean, just wipe it with a damp cloth. (package contains a cleaning tools )","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LcS84vW+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOXTON","source_asin":"B0B41QGR8W","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-72630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B41QGR8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B41QGR8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
