window.products.push({"id":72685,"name":"Waterdrop DA29-00020B NSF 53&42 Certified Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for Samsung DA29-00020B, DA29-00020A, HAF-CIN/EXP, 46-9101, WDS-F27, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Up7tPDmGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Compatible with multiple models] DA29-00020B, HAF-CIN, HAF-CIN/EXP, RF28HMEDBSR, RS25J500DSR, RF263BEAESR, HDX FMS-2, DA29-00020B-1, DA97-08006A-1, RF4287HARS, RF263BEAESG, RF263TEAESG, RF28HFEDBSR, RF28HDEDBSR, RFG297HDRS, RS25H5111SR, RS25J500DSG, RF23J9011SR, RF263BEAESR/AA, RS265TDRS, RH22H9010SR, RF25HMEDBSR, RS25J500DSR/AA, RF28K9380SR, RF23J9011SR/AA, RF26J7500SR/AA, RF28HMEDBSR/AA, RF4287HABP, RFG298HDRS [Replacement for multiple models] WS627, CF7, AQF-FF27, WD-F27, WDP-F27, MB-F27, FL-RF27, RWF0700A, GF-20B, PL-200, CWMF021, FIN-7, R-9101, APF-0300, WF294 [Authoritative Certifications] This Waterdrop WDS-F27 water filter replacement for Samsung refrigerators, trusted by American families, has been certified by NSF and IAPMO against NSF/ANSI standards 53, 42, and 372 for effective reduction of 20 substances, offering outstanding filtration and high-quality water purification and bringing healthy drinking water. [Deep Filtration] This filter has been strictly certified against NSF/ANSI 42 for reduction of chlorine, taste and odor and against NSF/ANSI 53 for reduction of over 99.6% of lead, 96.6% of benzene, carbofuran and endrin. Certified by IAPMO, this filter can reduce 11 harmful chemicals like 99.59% of ethylbenzene, 99.99% of o-dichlorobenzene, toxaphene, Atrazine and MTBE to produce clean, pure water. Furthermore, it can reduce PFOA and PFOS according to testing. [Great fit, hassle-free installation] Say goodbye to worries about water leaks caused by loose or improper replacement refrigerator filters. Our Waterdrop Replacement Refrigerator Water Filter is crafted using industrial automation and precision measurement technology, guaranteeing a great fit just like the original. Plus, you won't need any tools to install it. Simply follow our provided installation guide, and you'll have it up and running in minutes. [Premium filtering material] We've taken a major leap forward from less efficient charcoal filters that rely on a mix of coal, wood, walnut husks, and apricot husks to filter water. Our filter material is crafted using 100% Sri Lankan selected coconut shell coal block, which boasts a 2x larger specific surface area and more micropores for vastly improved filtering efficacy. Say goodbye to impurities and enjoy pure, clean water with our great filter material. [Fresh-tasting water] Enjoy cleaner, purer water with the Waterdrop refrigerator water filter! Designed to reduce impurities and contaminants, our filter ensures that your family has access to fresh, crisp water all year round. Say goodbye to bottled water and hello to the convenience of always having clean, great-tasting water right from your refrigerator. [Free monthly installation stickers] Never worry about monitoring the lifespan of your refrigerator water filter again! With Waterdrop Refrigerator Water Filter, you'll receive free monthly installation stickers that keep track of the filter's lifespan at all times. Our filter lasts up to 6 months or 300 gallons, depending on the actual water conditions. Enjoy fresh and clean water without the hassle of constantly checking your filter. [BPA-free and food-grade materials] At Waterdrop, your safety comes first. Our refrigerator water filter is made from BPA-free and food-grade materials, certified to NSF 372 lead-free standards, ensuring that you only drink the clean and tasting water. [Purified with love] Our mission is to provide pure water to everyone, anywhere. We're not just a business - we're dedicated to using our technology for good. That's why we donate a portion of each purchase to bring clean water to children in water-scarce regions of Africa. Every purchase you make helps make a difference in the lives of those in need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Up7tPDmGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B0BVFQY9HH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-72685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVFQY9HH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVFQY9HH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
