window.products.push({"id":72692,"name":"Waterdrop WF401 Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for Amana Clean N Clear WF401, WF401S, 12527304, 46-9014, 469014, 1 Filter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zCA1scMzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A filter you can trust: This filter we put our name to adopts high-precision natural activated carbon block to execute the best water purification performance. It effectively reduces chlorine, taste and odor, rust, corrosion, sediment, and turbidity. Simply replace your filter every six months, or after 350 gallons, and enjoy the clean water you and your family deserve. This has been tested and proven by an independent third-party laboratory. Selected filtration material: Our dedicated R&D team works day and night to ensure our filters provide your family with the purest, safest water anywhere in the world. By harnessing the power of natural active coconuts sourced from Sri Lanka, we adopt the coconut activated carbon block that ensures you get nothing but the best when you choose our products. Replacement for models: WF401, 12527304, WF40, 46-9904, WF292, WSA-1,Tier1 RWF1090, Amana WF401P, WF401S, WF401T, WF292, BCF92. Perfect fit: Waterdrop combines precision measurement technology to perfectly reproduce the original scale parameters with advanced industrial automation equipment. We aim to produce 100%-fit refrigerator water filters with an exquisite engineering design, unlike inferior replacement filters that have issues with water leakage. Also, we strive to save your precious time by offering tool-free, no-mess refrigerator water filter replacement. Fresh-tasting water: The 100% coconut shell carbon block can adsorb more impurities than low-priced and mixed carbon block. The Waterdrop WF401 refrigerator water filter significantly improves the taste of drinking water to bring you a unique experience. Be responsible for each product: Each product, or even a small component manufactured by Waterdrop, must pass an extremely high-standard examination to reach the top requirements on the market. These standards don’t end once the filter leaves our factory. Waterdrop will take full responsibility for each filter. Our 24/7 customer service team will provide a water purification solution at any time. Purified with love: We believe everyone, wherever they are, has the right to drink pure water. We hope to use what benefits us to benefit more people. For every purchase, we donate clean water to children in water-scarce regions in Africa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zCA1scMzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B01CCCS28K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-72692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CCCS28K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CCCS28K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
