window.products.push({"id":72784,"name":"Broan-NuTone E5490SS 36-inch Island Convertible Chimney-Style Range Hood with 3-Speed Exhaust Fan and Light, 550 Max Blower CFM, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1499.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31z6OmaIy6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Upgrade your kitchen with the Broan-NuTone 36-inch Island Chimney Range Hood! This versatile range hood offers a complete solution to your ventilation needs by providing both an exhaust fan and overhead light for your stove. This range hood provides a MAX 550 CFM and 9.5 Sones blower performance to quickly remove smoke and cooking odors from the air, and the 3-speed slide control allows for quick fan adjustments and provides the ideal level of ventilation every time you cook. The heat sentry detects excessive heat and adjusts blower speed automatically for convenience. The four built-in lights accept up to 40-watt halogen bulbs to evenly illuminate your cooking area. This sleek stainless steel range hood is designed to be installed over your kitchen island, and it features a modern chimney-style design to provide a more decorative look. The a one-piece dishwasher-safe aluminum grease filter offers easy cleaning so you can maintain optimum grease capture and keep your kitchen ventilated. This convertible range hood unit measures 27.56\" x 36\" x 35\" and is designed to fit 6\" round vertical ductwork for simple installation as well as non-ducted installation with an indoor exhaust recirculation kit (sold separately). The ducted/non-ducted telescopic flue accommodates ceiling heights from 8' to 9' tall with extensions sold separately to accommodate ceiling heights from 9' to 10' - mounting height may be affected by ceiling height. It is HVI-2100 Certified for safety and protection, and it includes a 1 year limited warranty. Enhance your kitchen with the Broan-NuTone E5490SS Range Hood! From the Manufacturer Elegant symmetry from every angle. Graceful curves and a low-profile design make this island hood at home in any decor. Multi-speed slide control allows you to choose the perfect speed to keep up with whatever you are cooking. Four 20 watt halogen lights (included) provide unparalleled lighting over and around the cook top. Dishwasher-safe aluminum filters ensure your hood will capture grease at optimum levels with regular cleaning. Telescopic flue accommodates 8-Feet to 9-Feet ceilings -- optional flue extension available for ducted (FX54SS) and non-ducted (FXN54SS) applications. Internal blower delivers 480 CFM (less than 300 CFM when using ARP6 reducer). Non-ducted kit RK54 for indoor recirculation (purchased separately); order replacement filter FILTERSQUARE to keep the kitchen fresh. Heat Sentry detects excessive heat and adjusts blower speed to high automatically to prolong product life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31z6OmaIy6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan-NuTone","source_asin":"B000Q7TJ22","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-72784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000Q7TJ22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B000Q7TJ22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
